    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong><br>The story is set in a city overrun by zombies. As the last survivor, you are driven to the brink by hordes of zombies. Use barricades as your final defense line and engage in a desperate battle against the endless zombie waves to protect your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Weapon Choices</strong>: From shotguns and submachine guns to revolvers, pistols, sniper rifles, Molotov cocktails, and grenades\u2014arm yourself with a variety of weapons to combat the zombie hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cover-Based Combat</strong>: Zombies will prioritize attacking your barricades. Strategically use cover to enjoy the thrill of standing alone against countless zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Upgrade System</strong>: Defeat zombies to earn coins, which can be used to enhance your weapon power or physical attributes, giving you the edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Swarm Assault</strong>: Over time, zombies will swarm like a tide, continuously invading your stronghold. Despite standing alone, you have unlimited ammunition at your disposal\u2014fire away without worrying about running out of bullets!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong><br>The story is set in a city overrun by zombies. As the last survivor, you are driven to the brink by hordes of zombies. Use barricades as your final defense line and engage in a desperate battle against the endless zombie waves to protect your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Weapon Choices</strong>: From shotguns and submachine guns to revolvers, pistols, sniper rifles, Molotov cocktails, and grenades\u2014arm yourself with a variety of weapons to combat the zombie hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cover-Based Combat</strong>: Zombies will prioritize attacking your barricades. Strategically use cover to enjoy the thrill of standing alone against countless zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Upgrade System</strong>: Defeat zombies to earn coins, which can be used to enhance your weapon power or physical attributes, giving you the edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Swarm Assault</strong>: Over time, zombies will swarm like a tide, continuously invading your stronghold. Despite standing alone, you have unlimited ammunition at your disposal\u2014fire away without worrying about running out of bullets!</p></li></ul>",
